<TD class="right"></TD>
</TR>
<TR>
<TD class="left border-right-single primary-indent-hanging-2">Separately evaluate both visual impairment due to eyelid loss and nonvisual impairment, e.g., disfigurement (diagnostic code 7800), and combine the evaluations.
